 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "vo01",
   "beat": "hook",
   "text": "Deep in your skin, right now, a new cell is being born.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "01.wav",
   "dur": 4.83,
   "sha256": "1ebc2cab47a696c9dcab709d42ec2f73c42b426d928ee4037f681561604db95c"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo02",
   "beat": "normal",
   "text": "It starts at the very bottom… and slowly begins to rise.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "02.wav",
   "dur": 5.48,
   "sha256": "c4bf7cad275c6117755c56858c08fb51f77306c3e7f2fc7c747008f7ff8c8bb5"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo03",
   "beat": "change",
   "text": "As it climbs, it fills with a tough protein called keratin. It grows flatter… and flatter.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "03.wav",
   "dur": 8.18,
   "sha256": "dc0ca13ba2d2001e7c810a4877775790735b79811287bcdb72ae30a128a3e2d0"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo04",
   "beat": "why",
   "text": "Near the top, it lets go of its nucleus… and its life gently ends.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "04.wav",
   "dur": 7.38,
   "sha256": "d909429d57252aaf8471f9b50c5f91f1d3121b03353119c17b89113b826f48e8"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo05",
   "beat": "why",
   "text": "So the skin you can touch right now is made of cells that have finished their lives.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "05.wav",
   "dur": 6.21,
   "sha256": "621e65c614b3449fcc78b977f650ff338a23f69476dc7858f18c61a9ddaa0f8c"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo06",
   "beat": "whoa",
   "text": "Stacked like bricks, they seal in water.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "06.wav",
   "dur": 4.18,
   "sha256": "3c0050423a78275d30b0fa7b895a2c481a4402bc736d7fc6893c3f3bce164285"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo07",
   "beat": "whoa",
   "text": "The whole journey takes about a month.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "07.wav",
   "dur": 3.7,
   "sha256": "49d066e1769c6e9d9d25218b150394f0e7c398bee82ee6ecb52fc3f1cbac0982"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo08",
   "beat": "takeaway",
   "text": "Then, quietly, the top cells drift away, far too small to see. Some of the dust in your home… began as you.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "08.wav",
   "dur": 10.1,
   "sha256": "f16eb79b4e8f640aa06a2de3aa25920ff3e2a9f6b0d171e66a918e81a988a70f"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo09",
   "beat": "takeaway",
   "text": "Underneath, new cells are already rising. Always rebuilding… from the bottom up.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "09.wav",
   "dur": 7.94,
   "sha256": "37e6ac488ddad746b302e3ccb508fb9344e5bf40fa9df9669cbb113144ebf76e"
  }
 ]
}